C-side: the transient fails mid-run (a negative-resistance node kicked at 100 ns grows without bound)

load "resistor.osdi"
load "capacitor.osdi"

model vsrc vsource
model isrc isource
model r resistor
model c capacitor
model g vccs

v_d2a (nin 0) vsrc type="pwl" file="code:libcosim_bridge.so:vacask_bridge_init:d2a:nin"
r0 (nin 0) r r=1k

ikick (0 n) isrc type="pulse" val0=0 val1=1u delay=100n rise=1n fall=1n width=1n
g1 (n 0 n 0) g gain=-11m
r1 (n 0) r r=1k
c1 (n 0) c c=1p

control
  analysis tran1 tran step=1n stop=1u
endc
